{
  "bookId": "rewind-5",
  "id": "chapter-20",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3124001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "快到了，再坚持一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江和我为大家带路，尤娜、小惠一定要看顾好樱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "天启的马仔随时有可能追上来，我们得加倍小心！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "真的非常感谢……如果樱真的能变回原来的样子，要我怎么答谢你们都可以……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "我、我愿意和姐姐一起感谢你们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "别这么说，樱变成这样，我们也有一份责任。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你们……要把樱带去哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你这个混蛋，怎么一直缠着我们不放？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我……我想看看樱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "走开，离我们的樱远一点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "如果不是你，樱难道会变成现在这副模样吗……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……对不起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这不是我想看到的……我可以发誓。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你发誓有什么用！你能把原来的樱还给我们吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "能不能……让我跟你们一起……远远地看樱一眼就好……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你又在打什么坏主意？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "不，我没有……我只是想帮樱……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "你够了！你离我们远一点才是最大的帮忙，知道吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "尤娜……不要这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "莉可在把涂料交给樱之前，并不知道这种涂料的真实效用。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "从另一角度看，她也是一个无辜的受害者。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "……随便你们，她要加入进来也可以，只是要发誓，再也不单独和樱见面。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你！……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "呵呵，这么快就暴露本来面目了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "好，我答应你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "莉可，并不是每一次犯错都有悔过的机会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3124028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……我知道的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-150",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
