      ],
      "title": "#1 寻求帮助"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3125001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们到了！就在前面！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这里还真是一点都没变呢，好怀念呀~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "优纪，和江？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "怎么是你们？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哈哈哈好久不见呀，玲~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你们怎么会突然出现在这里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "事情是这样的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "优纪把天启研制神秘涂料的事情经过转告给玲，当她得知有不少手办受这种神秘涂料的影响发生狂化之后，神色不禁严肃起来。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你的意思是，正常的手办在被这种神秘涂料涂装之后，就会变得狂躁不安？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不仅如此，这些被狂化的手办，破坏能力也极具增强。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "手办涂装的原理并不复杂，只是通常来说，用于手办涂装的颜料在手办制作完成后，会一直保持使用同一款。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "也因此，我们手办能够保存过去和现在的记忆。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "原来手办的记忆与涂装有着这样的关联……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "只是，从你们在天启那里得到的情报来看，这种神秘涂料在逆转整个手办的制作流程。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "可以解释得更详细一点吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "就是说，这种神秘涂料的作用，是霸道地删除原来的记忆。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这是不是意味着，被狂化之后的手办和原来已经不一样了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "是的，可以这么理解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "因为涂装已经彻底被覆盖，原本的记忆荡然无存。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "这不可能……这不是真的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "樱她……怎么可能不是原来的自己……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125023",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "都怪你！！把樱还给我们！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……对不起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125025",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "对不起有什么用啦！对不起能把原来的樱还给我们吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你……你既然了解这么多涂装的事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "能不能把樱变回原来的样子……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是啊，玲，这也是我跟和江来找你的原因，请你帮帮我们，帮帮可怜的樱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我不能保证一定可以让樱恢复。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3125032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "但我愿意试试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-151",
